card.statement:
The module $\widetilde{M}_{\eta, a}$ is $U({G}_-\oplus \mathbb C d)$-free;

- The module $M_{\eta, a}$ is a $G$-submodule of $\widetilde{M}_{\eta, a}$;

- If $\eta |_{\widehat{\mathfrak g}_{n\delta}}\neq 0$ for infinitely many integer $n>0$ then the module $\widetilde{M}_{\eta, a}$ is irreducible. In this case $\widetilde{M}_{\eta, a}$ is the unique (up to isomorphism) irreducible Whittaker module of type $\eta$ with central charge $a$.
